  "description": "Rear dormer extension spanning across 221 and 221A Rotherhithe Street. To provide extra internal space for loft conversions to form 1 extra bedroom with a shower-room in each property. New internal staircases are also proposed to create access to the loft. A roof light on the front elevation will be installed to provide light into the loft space. Solar panels are also proposed on the roof and dormer flat roof to provide renewable energy to the properties, as drawn. These will not exceed 150mm protrusion and due to the building height, should not be visible from street level. Solar panels will be installed on the roofs as drawn and should not be visible from street view.",
